# Identity UI build-time settings — copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in.
# Every variable here is PUBLIC: SvelteKit bakes `PUBLIC_*` into the client
# bundle, so nothing secret belongs in this file.
#
# All are optional and an empty `.env` is fine for `pnpm dev`. A production
# build must set PUBLIC_ETHEREUM_RPC_URL, or it serves no site at all.

# Reown Cloud (formerly WalletConnect Cloud) project id. Without it the wallet
# picker offers no WalletConnect, only the injected wallets and Coinbase Wallet.
# It chooses which Reown project the pairings are counted against and
# allowlisted by.
#
# Get one free at https://dashboard.reown.com and register every origin you
# serve from (http://localhost:5500 for `pnpm dev`). Reown's allowlist is meant
# to keep a project's relay to the origins it names, so an origin the project
# does not name may not be able to pair at all.
# PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# Account-bus signaling server (docs/Account-Bus.md). `pnpm dev` falls back to
# the local server on ws://localhost:5520. A production build with this unset
# runs with no account bus across partitions and devices, and still works. The
# solarpunkid.bzz.link build leaves it unset unless a server is set up for it.
# PUBLIC_BUS_SIGNALING_URL=

# The site allow list (docs/Site-Allow-List.md). Swarm ID serves only the sites
# named in a text record on an ENS name, read over an Ethereum mainnet JSON-RPC
# endpoint. With no endpoint every site is refused, except the dev origins of a
# development build.
# PUBLIC_ETHEREUM_RPC_URL=
# The ENS name and its text record key. Defaults: solarpunkid.eth and
# buzz.solarpunk.sites.
# PUBLIC_SITE_ALLOW_LIST_ENS_NAME=
# PUBLIC_SITE_ALLOW_LIST_RECORD_KEY=
# Origins a development build serves without the chain, separated by spaces or
# commas. Unset, a development build serves the demo on port 3500. A production
# build ignores this.
# PUBLIC_SITE_ALLOW_LIST_DEV_ORIGINS=

# The Bee node used while a person has set none in Network settings, and the
# value Reset puts back. Unset, it is https://api.gateway.ethswarm.org/. A value
# that is not an http or https URL is ignored and that default stands.
# PUBLIC_DEFAULT_BEE_NODE_URL=
